adr: ADR-1462
evidence: RTX 4090, --precision max: the kernels read the CPU's log2 table, uploaded at init (all 32768 entries equal, test_cuda_vif_log2_table); 1392 of 1392 scores on 348 frames (Netflix 576x324 at 8 to 16 bit and 4:2:2, 1080p checkerboards, Sparks 10 bit, BBB 4K 200 frames, noise at 8 to 16 bit and at 40x40 to 64x64, bright 16-bit 1080p) identical to --backend cpu, debug=true, vif_enhn_gain_limit=1.0 and vif_skip_scale0 too.
